# clang-tidy configuration for this project's C++ code (packages/kuura-frost/,
# the first C++ this project ships -- see docs/BUILD_CONTRACT.md's history and
# scripts/run_static_analysis.ps1 for why this exists now: Semgrep's own C++
# parser is unreliable for modern C++ (silently skips translation units using
# C++17+ constructs it does not understand while still reporting "0 findings"),
# so clang-tidy is this project's real C++ static analysis, not a supplement.
#
# Check groups, and why each is included:
#   clang-analyzer-*      real static-analysis passes (UB, null derefs, leaks)
#   bugprone-*            common real-bug patterns
#   cppcoreguidelines-*   C++ Core Guidelines (lifetimes, ownership, casts) --
#                         directly relevant to a GL/shader-resource-owning
#                         KWin effect plugin (Vaihe 4)
#   modernize-*           idiomatic C++20 usage (this project targets C++20,
#                         see packages/kuura-frost/CMakeLists.txt)
#   performance-*         relevant given Vaihe 4's explicit per-frame budget
#   portability-*         this code only ever targets the pinned Arch/Linux
#                         toolchain (see build/Containerfile), but the check
#                         group is cheap and catches real non-portable
#                         constructs that are also just bad practice
#
# Excluded, with reasons (do not remove without understanding why):
#   -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers, -readability-magic-numbers
#     Shader/graphics code is inherently full of small numeric constants
#     (uniform locations, channel indices, matrix sizes) that a "magic
#     number" check would flag near-universally with no real bug behind it.
#   -modernize-use-trailing-return-type
#     Purely stylistic; this project's existing style (see any .py generator
#     for the analogous convention) does not use trailing return types.
Checks: >
  clang-analyzer-*,
  bugprone-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type

WarningsAsErrors: ""
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*packages/kuura-.*/src/.*'
FormatStyle: none
